{"step_index":199,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-07T06:21:51Z","input_tokens":3609,"cache_read_tokens":197336,"output_tokens":973,"content":"I have created the comprehensive implementation plan for the **Network Ad Blocker, Web Traffic Tracker & Analytics Engine**, along with the **Screenshot Engine**, **Automated Test Suite**, and the complete **Documentation Suite**.\n\nAll previous brain files have been copied to [**`brain_archive/`**](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/brain_archive).\n\nPlease review the full plan artifact:\n👉 [**Architecture & Implementation Plan: Network Ad Blocker & Web Inspector**](file:///C:/Users/thann/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f941cc48-3dd0-4ea9-a4df-91daf625a4db/adblocker_plan.md)\n\n### Key Architectural Highlights:\n1. **Network Ad Blocker & Traffic Interceptor Proxy (Port 8080):**\n   - Intercepts both HTTP and HTTPS `CONNECT` tunnels, matching domain SNI against 5,000+ curated advertising, tracker, telemetry, and malware domains.\n   - Blocks ad requests instantly with `403 Forbidden` and streams clean traffic transparently.\n2. **Browsing Tracker & Analytics Engine:**\n   - Tracks every single website browsed with exact date, time, domain, protocol, category, and blocking status.\n   - Provides analytics on total queries, top visited sites, top blocked ad networks, and categorical breakdown.\n3. **1-Click Windows System Proxy Integration:**\n   - Toggles system-wide proxy (`127.0.0.1:8080`) so all laptop browsers (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Brave) automatically route through AegisShield without manual browser configuration.\n4. **Screenshot Engine & Automated Testing Suite:**\n   - [**`tools/screenshot_engine.py`**](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/tools/screenshot_engine.py): Captures full-resolution screenshots of all dashboard tabs into `screenshots/`.\n